# The browser bundles below are generated into public/resources by the `prepare`
# lifecycle script during the in-image `npm ci`/`npm install`. Excluding them here
# keeps `COPY .` from overwriting the builder's freshly-built copies with a
# developer's stale local ones (which are not tracked in git).
